WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.510
A nuptial agreement is made before you marry, or after you are already married.

2
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:17.120
In England and Wales it is not automatically binding. A court is more likely to follow it if it is fair, you each had your own legal advice, and you each disclosed your finances.

3
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:24.360
Say which agreement this is, list the assets in outline, and say whether that advice has already been given.
